('f33','TEC-25-F03',0,$j${"date":"2026-11-11","text":"1.AI知识库文件上线情况。目前系统中文件已达661，文件上线进度正常（解析慢、解析卡等问题较少出现）\n\n2.KMS知识库API接口数据对接。将数据分为这几块：\n2.1 三册手册\n①数据法律合规评估（已完成）\n②KMS接口开发（软件层面已完成）\n③CMS接口开发（进行中，预计下周一进行联调）\n④nas盘数据跨境流程流程（已完成）\n⑤防火墙流程（已完成）\n⑥nas访问账号流程（已完成）\n⑦当前存量数据可在OSS上直接访问，但OSS仅存有HTML格式文件，待AI项目确定能否传输、能否直接用（不能直接用，当前KMS仅能接收别人推送的信息，也无法接受OSS中的HTML文件压缩包）\n⑧增量数据需与CMS对接，开发接口后推增量数据。（进行中）\n以上步骤走完后，再开始数据传输测试。\n2.2 EPC数据----已按车型上传现有EPC数据\n从TIS端获取，流程已走完，已上传一版EPC数据。后续长期数据方案待讨论。\n2.3 TIS本身的数据----本周无进度，待排期\n即SN、TN、用户手册等文档，TIS的杜宝兴可协助完成API接口对接。当前接口正在对接中，待KMS系统升级完进行测试。\n\n3.AI架构换成Agent的进程。\n目前已开通Diclaw使用权限，预计在本周四或周五发布使用指引，指引发布之后可开始试用。","by":"朱泓源Janson"}$j$::jsonb),
('f34','TEC-25-F05',0,$j${"date":"2026-11-11","text":"一、本周进展\n（1）功能试用：截至目前共开20个VDS设备的功能权限，试用反馈收集中。\n（2）问题反馈：问题反馈集中在 ①数据清洗不完善（比如说个别故障码点不动手册）以及②车型匹配逻辑待开发（车型与手册的对应逻辑待完善，比如说，一个车型会有多本手册，同时很多不同年份款的车型都可以使用同一本手册，但对应关系需要再完善开发，目标是先能够让用户手动选择对应的手册，而不是直接查无此册）。\n（3）车型对应功能开发：已开会讨论，加快完善欧洲VDS诊断ID与手册的关联，支持用户手动选择对应手册，预计11月25日前完成开发。\n（4）后续开发：先处理对应关系的逻辑问题，优化完后马上进行“精准搜索”相关字段接口计划启动开发联调。\n二、下周计划\n（1）持续跟进一期手册匹配功能开发及已反馈问题的处理进展，做好后续验证准备。\n（2）继续收集试用反馈，重点跟踪不同车型及配置的手册匹配准确性，为市场开放提供依据。","by":"朱泓源Janson"}$j$::jsonb),
('f34','TEC-25-F05',1,$j${"date":"2026-10-28","text":"1.本周进展\n（1）完成在线诊断功能操作指导及 Jotform 设备 UUID 收集、试用意见反馈表准备，已提交Janson，供区域试用推广使用。\n（2）与国内开发对齐当前推进重点：优先开展一期功能的多车型、多设备验证，重点检查手册匹配准确性及功能稳定性，为后续扩大欧洲试用范围提供依据。\n（3）明确手册匹配优化方向：在 VIN 精准关联完善前，通过手动选择对应车型配置的手册作为过渡方案。\n2.下周计划\n（1）跟进区域试用安排，持续收集设备 UUID、车型及使用反馈。\n（2）汇总手册匹配、资料查阅及操作过程中的问题，反馈国内开发跟踪修复、复测。\n（3）在一期测试推进基础上，与国内开发进一步对齐 VIN 精准关联、精准搜索等二期功能的开发和具体的时间计划。","by":"朱泓源Janson"}$j$::jsonb),
('f36','TEC-26-F09',0,$j${"date":"2026-11-11","text":"结论先行：主线方案转向防火毯。\n防爆箱VS.防火毯：防爆箱在安全等级上高于防火毯，但在成本，重量体积，使用方法及性价比上不占优。\n防爆箱VS.水箱：与水箱对比，防爆箱性价比没有明显优势，使用频率低、成本高、体积大，近期推电池维修项目时经销商态度较为排斥。\n\n市场配置：各市场防火毯配置及采购能力依然在评估，新增反馈市场有丹麦，剩余市场没有反馈，会继续跟进。\n\n落地建议：1. 统一防火毯技术规格 2. 纳入动力电池的安全维修项，加在TQC审计项里","by":"赵栋Alex"}$j$::jsonb),
('f36','TEC-26-F09',1,$j${"date":"2026-10-28","text":"重新收集各市场防火毯的资源情况，需要明确到品牌及规格。当前罗马尼亚，英国（右舵），意大利，瑞典，德国有反馈，其他国家正在收集中。\n在新方案没有完全敲定下来之前，各市场将沿用水箱方案，用于审计或电池降级；","by":"赵栋Alex"}$j$::jsonb),
('f37','CVS-26-F01',0,$j${"date":"2026-11-11","text":"1-3-6 Active Service 标准化 SOP 与客户关怀体系11月份开始会在所有项目实施。","by":"杨琛Chen, 刘澳强John"}$j$::jsonb),
('f37','CVS-26-F01',1,$j${"date":"2026-10-28","text":"已成立由杨琛牵头、商用车各区域经理组成的大客户专属跟踪小组，建立1-3-6 Active Service 标准化 SOP 与客户关怀体系10月份开始已经在区域重点项目中试点落地。","by":"杨琛Chen, 刘澳强John"}$j$::jsonb),
('f38','CVS-26-F02',0,$j${"date":"2026-11-11","text":"已完成欧洲重卡主流 OEM 质保标准的横向深度对标，目前完成RENAULT ,DAF, MAN,VOLVO 和 SCANIA, 并围绕质保提升 20% 目标完成财务预留测算与成本差异分析。","by":"杨琛Chen, 刘澳强John"}$j$::jsonb),
('f38','CVS-26-F02',1,$j${"date":"2026-10-28","text":"已完成欧洲重卡主流 OEM 质保标准的横向深度对标，目前完成VOLVO 和 SCANIA, 并围绕质保提升 20% 目标完成财务预留测算与成本差异分析。","by":"杨琛Chen, 刘澳强John"}$j$::jsonb),
('f39','CVS-26-F03',0,$j${"date":"2026-11-11","text":"大巴标书质保测算优于欧洲主流竞品，我们的质保报价全部低于欧洲一线 OEM 报价, 销售对质保报价暂时没有任何意见。","by":"杨琛Chen, 刘澳强John"}$j$::jsonb),
('f39','CVS-26-F03',1,$j${"date":"2026-10-28","text":"按照我们目前搜集整理的投标数据，大巴标书质保测算优于欧洲主流竞品，我们的质保报价全部低于欧洲一线 OEM 报价，昨天在荷兰和销售开了一天的投标专题研讨会议，我们全力配合销售拿单，销售可以给我们目标价格，我们根据目标价格输出售后报价。目前我们的策略是非常激进的，比欧洲所有OEM的报价都低不止2%-3%。 李总指示不参与宇通等国内厂商不可持续的低价恶性竞争。","by":"杨琛Chen, 刘澳强John"}$j$::jsonb);
insert into public.projects (id, code, kind, team, section, status, name, data) values
('p254','EAS-2026-BNB-008','project','CHE','','active','Swiss Winter Complete Wheel',$j${"section":"","old":"","oldNew":"EAS-2026-BNB-008","team":"CHE","name":"Swiss Winter Complete Wheel","scope":"Project Background\nEstablishing a professional winter wheel solution for BYD Switzerland is essential to meeting customer expectations, strengthening the brand’s market competitiveness, and capturing additional After Sales business opportunities.\n\nSwiss customers expect a complete and professional winter wheel solution directly from the brand. Without an official BYD solution, dealers may establish their own suppliers and processes, resulting in fragmented operations, reduced margin potential, and lost After Sales business for BYD.\n\nFurthermore, Q4 is a critical sales period in Switzerland, when many automotive brands offer free winter wheels or winter tyres as part of their sales campaigns. To remain competitive and avoid potential disadvantages in the market, BYD may also need to consider similar promotional measures, depending on the competitive landscape.\n\nTherefore, establishing a reliable winter wheel provider and implementing a complete winter wheel solution for BYD Switzerland by the beginning of Q4 is a business priority. This project aims to deliver a professional, brand-aligned solution that meets customer expectations, supports dealer operations, and maximizes After Sales business potential.\n\n\nExecution Scope & Expected Deliverables\n\n1.1 Execution Scope\n\nMarket & Timeline\nThe project will focus exclusively on the Swiss market, covering the winter season from Q4 2026 to Q1 2027.\n\nDemand Scope\nBased on the planned delivery of 6,460 vehicles in Switzerland from April to December 2026, the project will initially target an estimated demand equivalent to 20–25% of Swiss dealers’ demand for OEM Winter Complete Wheels (WCW). This provides a focused and manageable starting point for the first winter season.\n\nSupplier Selection & Localization\nThe tender and supplier selection process will prioritize partners capable of serving the specific requirements of the Swiss market. As Switzerland operates outside the EU and has its own currency, market conditions, and operational requirements, a localized supply solution is essential to ensure commercial viability, operational efficiency, and reliable dealer fulfillment.\n\n1.2 Expected Deliverables & Business Benefits\n\n1. Reliable Product Availability & Dealer Fulfillment\nEnsure the timely availability and delivery of Winter Complete Wheels to Swiss dealers, supporting vehicle sales, meeting seasonal demand, and strengthening dealer relationships and customer loyalty.\n\n2. Enhanced After Sales Business Opportunities\nCapture additional revenue and margin potential through an official BYD winter wheel offering, while reducing the risk of fragmented dealer-level sourcing and missed business opportunities.\n\n3. Improved Customer Experience & Brand Positioning\nProvide Swiss customers with a professional, convenient, and brand-aligned winter wheel solution, reinforcing BYD’s commitment to local market needs and after-sales service quality.\n\n4. Strengthened Dealer Network Alignment\nEstablish a consistent supply and service approach across the Swiss dealer network, improving coordination, product availability, and the overall customer experience.\n\n5. Increased Market Competitiveness\nEnable BYD Switzerland to respond effectively to seasonal market expectations and competitors’ winter wheel promotions, supporting vehicle sales and protecting BYD’s competitive position during the peak winter season.\n\n6. Foundation for Future Scalability\nBuild a practical operating model with localized supplier cooperation, demand planning, and fulfillment processes that can be evaluated and further optimized for subsequent winter seasons.","pic":"Paolo Liistro","exec":["郑苗苗Aileen","陈金凤Kim","黄芮 Raina","赖红苑 Inco","周庭Evan","黄远珍Yuanzhen","唐熠璠 effy","林中洁Liam","赵捷 George"],"start":"2026-05-12","end":"2027-03-31","actual":null,"exts":[],"updates":[{"date":"2026-11-04","text":"Status Update – Winter Complete Wheels (AGOM/Pirelli)\nWe are in the final stage of the contract negotiations between the supplier AGOM/Pirelli and BYD Procurement. The financial terms, namely the dealer price and the recommended retail price, are still under review.\nThe first batch of original rims is in transit, and we expect delivery by mid-November. Once received, the supplier will fit the winter complete wheels.\nThe dealer network has been informed about the significant delay.","by":"Paolo Liistro"}],"origStatus":"In Progress","sheet":"Benelux&Nordic&Baltics","rf":"2026-11-12","nw":1,"kind":"project","status":"active","milestones":[{"id":"m1","name":"项目最终成果交付","due":"2027-03-31","forms":["文字","截图"],"done":false,"auto":true,"evidence":null}],"code":"EAS-2026-BNB-008","id":"p254","history":[{"at":"2026-11-12","by":"系统","text":"由新进度表同步（页签 Benelux&Nordic&Baltics，表内编号 EAS-2026-BNB-008）"}]}$j$::jsonb),
('p255','EAS-2026-BNB-009','project','CHE','','active','HV Battery Authorized Repair Network Development - Switzerland',$j${"section":"","old":"","oldNew":"EAS-2026-BNB-009","team":"CHE","name":"HV Battery Authorized Repair Network Development - Switzerland","scope":"Complete the establishment and go-live of the local Battery Repair Center by 31 December 2026. The Country Aftersales Team is responsible for local execution, while the European Technical Team and Backoffice provide unified technical standards, training, audit, and project management support. Site selection should consider local repair demand and the existing aftersales network, with priority given to synergies with Approved Bodyshop, Key Account/Fleet Service, and Trade Parts.\nPhased Deliverables: By the end of October, complete importer/dealer contract signing, tool procurement, and spare parts stocking; by the end of November, complete dealer training, site acceptance, and repair authorization; by the end of December, complete the local Battery Repair Center setup and official go-live","pic":"Paolo Liistro","exec":["Paolo Liistro"],"start":"2026-09-23","end":"2026-12-31","actual":null,"exts":[],"updates":[{"date":"2026-11-04","text":"This week, the supplier Liba24 sent us the draft contract. It is currently under review by Philipp Tong Man, after which we will submit it to Procurement.","by":"Paolo Liistro"}],"origStatus":"In Progress","sheet":"Benelux&Nordic&Baltics","rf":"2026-11-12","nw":1,"kind":"project","status":"active","milestones":[{"id":"m1","name":"项目最终成果交付","due":"2026-12-31","forms":["文字","截图"],"done":false,"auto":true,"evidence":null}],"code":"EAS-2026-BNB-009","id":"p255","history":[{"at":"2026-11-12","by":"系统","text":"由新进度表同步（页签 Benelux&Nordic&Baltics，表内编号 EAS-2026-BNB-009）"}]}$j$::jsonb),
('p256','EAS-2026-CEE-003','project','POL','','active','HV Battery Authorized Repair Network Development - Poland',$j${"section":"","old":"","oldNew":"EAS-2026-CEE-003","team":"POL","name":"HV Battery Authorized Repair Network Development - Poland","scope":"Complete the establishment and go-live of the local Battery Repair Center by 31 December 2026. The Country Aftersales Team is responsible for local execution, while the European Technical Team and Backoffice provide unified technical standards, training, audit, and project management support. Site selection should consider local repair demand and the existing aftersales network, with priority given to synergies with Approved Bodyshop, Key Account/Fleet Service, and Trade Parts.\nPhased Deliverables: By the end of October, complete importer/dealer contract signing, tool procurement, and spare parts stocking; by the end of November, complete dealer training, site acceptance, and repair authorization; by the end of December, complete the local Battery Repair Center setup and official go-live","pic":"Mariusz Kiljańczyk","exec":["Mariusz Kiljańczyk"],"start":"2026-09-23","end":"2026-12-31","actual":null,"exts":[],"updates":[{"date":"2026-11-04","text":"Initial team meeting – completed\nDiscussion with Harmony - pilot service – presentation of the project’s objectives, approval by Harmony\nSelection of local project staff from NSC and Harmony – completed\nRegistration for the EV Battery training course – 1 representative from NSC and 1 from Harmony","by":"Mariusz Kiljańczyk"}],"origStatus":"In Progress","sheet":"CEE","rf":"2026-11-12","nw":1,"kind":"project","status":"active","milestones":[{"id":"m1","name":"项目最终成果交付","due":"2026-12-31","forms":["文字","截图"],"done":false,"auto":true,"evidence":null}],"code":"EAS-2026-CEE-003","id":"p256","history":[{"at":"2026-11-12","by":"系统","text":"由新进度表同步（页签 CEE，表内编号 EAS-2026-CEE-003）"}]}$j$::jsonb),
('p257','EAS-2026-SEN-006','project','SEN','售后商务科','active','BYD欧洲经销商系统及VDS收费项目',$j${"section":"售后商务科","old":"","oldNew":"EAS-2026-SEN-006","team":"SEN","name":"BYD欧洲经销商系统及VDS收费项目","scope":"项目背景：\n当前多数OEM已针对系统和VDS订阅对授权经销商实行了收费。为覆盖BYD系统成本，特针对BYD的DMS/BSS、TIS和LMS三个系统制定全欧经销商的收费方案及VDS之后的订阅收费方案，该方案将于2027年对全欧执行。\n\n执行要求：\n调研其他主机厂系统及VDS的收费方案、收集BYD成本数据、对BYD的账号数量预测并预测利润情况、制定收费方案并最终落地。\n项目可交付成果：1.交付调研报告及收费方案 2.对全欧经销商执行该收费方案\nSOP：预计将于2026.10.30号报告调研成果及收费方案，如通过后将于2026.11.30号前进行预通知并最终于2027.1.1执行该收费方案。","pic":"段梦醒Blair","exec":["杜文研 Wenya"],"start":"2026-09-11","end":"2027-01-31","actual":null,"exts":[],"updates":[{"date":"2026-11-11","text":"1. 收费通知：已于2026.11.6对区域进行了系统和VDS订阅收费方案的邮件预通知，本周已撰写对外部经销商的通知和相关附件，包括收费方案和收费流程，预计本周三完成法务评估、本周四完成内部汇报并于本周五正式对外发放。\n2.系统方案输出：已于2026.11.5书面提交LMS同SPLM的系统对接以及关闭账号的功能需求、已于2026.11.4提交VDS系统收费订阅功能需求以及BSS和TIS系统的关闭账号的功能需求。后续三个系统的账号申请都将统一从splm系统开通。                  \n3. UI 交互：已通过figma画出splm系统的初版交互ui，下一步ethan将完成splm系统的ui界面上线。                                  \n 4.SAP系统对接：项目相关背景告知财务，财务提供相关发票模版。将模版给到sap相关团队进行后续收费开发。","by":"段梦醒Blair"},{"date":"2026-10-28","text":"1.已汇报确认BYD欧洲经销商系统的收费方案和VDS收费方案。系统收费方案为每服务店收费3500欧/年，包含六个基础账号，对于额外账号收费300欧/年/个。VDS系统收费方案为针对购买的VDS硬件赠送三年免费订阅，从第四年开始每年收费1800欧/年。                                   \n2.通过同peter和ethan沟通，确认当前系统和VDS购买和管理方案将搭建在SPLM经销商系统上，后续需打通SPLM同三大系统lms、tis、dms以及vds的接口连接，实现通过splm系统对经销商收费以及后续系统账号管理。                                       \n3.当前已出具详细系统方案需求，包括账号开通、账号收费、账号管理、收费规则等，确认各项方案完成的节点。","by":"段梦醒Blair"}],"origStatus":"In Progress","sheet":"服务工程部","rf":"2026-11-12","nw":1,"kind":"project","status":"active","milestones":[{"id":"m1","name":"项目最终成果交付","due":"2027-01-31","forms":["文字","截图"],"done":false,"auto":true,"evidence":null}],"code":"EAS-2026-SEN-006","id":"p257","history":[{"at":"2026-11-12","by":"系统","text":"由新进度表同步（页签 服务工程部，表内编号 EAS-2026-SEN-006）"}]}$j$::jsonb),
('p258','EAS-2026-SEN-007','project','SEN','渠道管理','active','BYD钣喷中心泛欧认证标准',$j${"section":"渠道管理","old":"","oldNew":"EAS-2026-SEN-007","team":"SEN","name":"BYD钣喷中心泛欧认证标准","scope":"项目背景\n随着比亚迪在欧洲的售后网络不断扩大，钣喷维修服务需要一套统一的标准，这是保证维修质量、运营效率和客户满意度的关键。本项目将制定并推行统一的钣喷中心认证体系，规范场地、设备、人员和服务要求，最终在欧洲建成高质量的钣喷维修网络。\n\n执行范围\n1、认证标准：完成并发布《欧洲钣喷中心认证标准》，配套内容包括 VIS 指引、设备与工具要求，以及认可的油漆材料清单。\n2、认证流程：建立并实施标准化的认证流程，涵盖申请提交、线上审核、现场审核、整改和正式授权。\n3、审核执行：按强制性要求开展认证评估，找出不符合项，并跟进整改。\n4、线上认证与授权：服务站达到钣喷认证标准、并在 SPLM 中完成授权流程后，其认证钣喷维修能力将在比亚迪官网和 App 上展示。\n\n交付成果\n1、定稿的《欧洲钣喷中心认证标准》及配套文件。\n2、标准化的认证流程、申请要求和审核清单。\n3、正式的认证结果和授权文件。\n4.、欧洲认证钣喷中心名单，以及认证进度跟踪。\n5、全渠道认证和授权展示。","pic":"黄明辉Brent","exec":["甄镒帆Jennie","Marek Raninec","汤睿Ray","王溢 Owen","黄国雯Holly"],"start":"2026-10-01","end":"2027-03-31","actual":null,"exts":[],"updates":[{"date":"2026-11-11","text":"1. 认证标准：已完成钣喷认证规范、设备工具手册、VIS 手册及认证油漆清单编制更新，全套材料已于 11 月 10 日下发各区域征集反馈，下周结合区域意见优化定稿。\n2. 认证流程：明确钣喷认证申请、审核、SPLM 授权审批相关要求，随同标准文件一并征求区域意见，收集反馈后形成正式执行文件。\n3. 系统开发：本周确认两类业务开发需求：存量机修门店新增钣喷 / 电池维修资质、独立维修中心准入审批，计划本月完成功能开发。\n4. 线上授权展示：官网及 APP 认证能力展示功能开发中。门店通过钣喷认证及 SPLM 授权后，对外展示钣喷维修资质。\n5. 培训筹备：已规划培训安排，待标准与流程定稿后，面向欧洲各区域渠道团队开展专项宣贯培训，确保落地一致。","by":"黄明辉Brent"}],"origStatus":"In Progress","sheet":"服务工程部","rf":"2026-11-12","nw":1,"kind":"project","status":"active","milestones":[{"id":"m1","name":"项目最终成果交付","due":"2027-03-31","forms":["文字","截图"],"done":false,"auto":true,"evidence":null}],"code":"EAS-2026-SEN-007","id":"p258","history":[{"at":"2026-11-12","by":"系统","text":"由新进度表同步（页签 服务工程部，表内编号 EAS-2026-SEN-007）"}]}$j$::jsonb),
('p259','EAS-2026-SEN-008','project','SEN','渠道管理','active','欧洲售后技术质量检查（TQC）体系建设',$j${"section":"渠道管理","old":"","oldNew":"EAS-2026-SEN-008","team":"SEN","name":"欧洲售后技术质量检查（TQC）体系建设","scope":"项目背景\n随着比亚迪在欧洲的售后网络不断扩大，需要建立一致的技术质量和服务标准，这对确保运营合规、服务质量和客户满意度至关重要。本项目将统一检查标准、执行流程和评估方法，制定并推行标准化的技术质量检查（TQC）体系。项目通过系统化的检查和整改跟进，推动持续改进，提升比亚迪欧洲售后网络的整体服务质量。\n\n执行范围\n1、TQC 检查标准：编制完整的 TQC 检查清单和检查指南，内容包括检查路线、检查方法、拍照要求、正确与错误示例，以及评分标准。\n2、流程与管控：建立标准化的 TQC 管理流程，明确各部门职责、检查范围、频次、关键节点、时间安排、责任人和预期产出。\n3、系统开发：通过系统支持前期需求收集、检查执行和结果跟踪。\n4、培训与落地：准备并开展培训，内容涵盖 TQC 检查清单、检查流程和系统操作，讲清楚查什么、怎么查、在哪查。\n5、检查工具：协调开发和配发所需的检查工具，包括照度计和卷尺。\n6、升级与响应：建立 TQC 问题升级和应急响应机制，处理严重问题并确保及时跟进。\n7、区域协同：与各区域团队对齐 TQC 的落地实施，并协调制定配套的商务政策。\n\n预期交付成果：\n1、标准化的 TQC 检查清单和执行指南。\n2、内部 TQC 管理流程，包括部门职责、检查频次、时间安排和工作流程。\n面向外部相关方的 TQC 商务政策。\n3、基于系统的需求收集和检查管理支持。\n4、TQC 培训材料和落地实施指引。\n5、标准化的检查工具包。\n6、TQC 问题升级与应急响应流程。\n7、TQC 检查结果与整改跟踪机制。","pic":"黄明辉Brent","exec":["汤睿Ray","王溢 Owen","甄镒帆Jennie"],"start":"2026-11-09","end":"2027-04-30","actual":null,"exts":[],"updates":[{"date":"2026-11-11","text":"1. 检查标准：2027 年 Q1 TQC 检查标准最新版已于 11 月 9 日同步至各区域，供各区域对照开展后续自查与现场检查工作。\n2. 检查指南：初稿已完成，计划本周定稿。指南将明确检查路线、拍照要求、检查方式，配套正误参考示例以及打分说明，方便检查人员统一执行口径。\n3. SPLM系统开发：需求已梳理完毕，系统coding中，计划本周完成 TQC 检查相关功能开发。\n4. 培训与落地：正在筹备检查标准、执行要求及系统操作的培训材料，预计下周输出培训计划，本月将组织各区域完成培训。","by":"黄明辉Brent"}],"origStatus":"In Progress","sheet":"服务工程部","rf":"2026-11-12","nw":1,"kind":"project","status":"active","milestones":[{"id":"m1","name":"项目最终成果交付","due":"2027-04-30","forms":["文字","截图"],"done":false,"auto":true,"evidence":null}],"code":"EAS-2026-SEN-008","id":"p259","history":[{"at":"2026-11-12","by":"系统","text":"由新进度表同步（页签 服务工程部，表内编号 EAS-2026-SEN-008）"}]}$j$::jsonb),
('p260','EAS-2026-SEN-009','project','SEN','售后商务科','active','成本精细化测算及成本优化',$j${"section":"售后商务科","old":"","oldNew":"EAS-2026-SEN-005","team":"SEN","name":"成本精细化测算及成本优化","scope":"现有备件成本测算及物流管理仍不够精细，同时存在尾端物流成本混入产品价格、低货值及小批量订单物流成本过高等问题，导致真实盈利难以准确反映。 根据李总指示，将成本精细化测算及备件发运降本作为重点项目，于2026年底前完成核心机制建设。\n\n执行范围：\n本项目将围绕成本精细化测算、物流成本优化、产品价格与运费分离、订单管理机制建设开展工作。\n项目可交付成果：1. 建立产品成本及物流费用精细化测算模型；2. 开发成本测算工具并输出标准化成本明细表；3. 完成空运发运原因及货柜经济性分析，形成物流成本优化措施；4. 制定最小起订金额及紧急订单等订单管理政策； 5. 推动备件发运降本，实现国际运费率由当前约7.9%降至第一阶段目标5%，第二阶段应用AI降到3.5%。","pic":"段梦醒Blair","exec":["陈金凤Kim","Minzhou Shi"],"start":"2026-10-05","end":"2026-12-31","actual":null,"exts":[],"updates":[{"date":"2026-11-11","text":"1. 成本测算工具：已完成欧洲及英国海关编码税率表收集，后续新增件将滚动更新。\n2. 输出欧洲及英国备件全量成本明细表；\n3. 国际运费优化- 空运：备件团队已制定空运管控措施，订单服务费等相关规范文件预计于下周完成。\n4.国际运费优化-包装体积：包装体积系数优化事项已执行, 当前正在测算体积系数优化后的国际运费占比。","by":"段梦醒Blair"},{"date":"2026-10-28","text":"成本测算由按fob货值分摊改成按sku实际产生费用做测算，已建立成本智能测算工具。\n1国际运费:已做空运海运分离，空运由备件团队制定管理规范并加以管控，当前分离后 根据2026上半年历史实际发运数据重新测算，已完成\n2.海关费用：关税由集团关务根据物料输出关税费率，已提供出版，完成度30%\n3.仓储及尾端费用：按照实际体积重分摊已完成","by":"段梦醒Blair"}],"origStatus":"In Progress","sheet":"服务工程部","rf":"2026-11-12","nw":1,"kind":"project","status":"active","milestones":[{"id":"m1","name":"项目最终成果交付","due":"2026-12-31","forms":["文字","截图"],"done":false,"auto":true,"evidence":null}],"code":"EAS-2026-SEN-009","id":"p260","history":[{"at":"2026-11-12","by":"系统","text":"由新进度表同步（页签 服务工程部，表内编号 EAS-2026-SEN-005）"}]}$j$::jsonb),
('f40','SEN-26-F03','follow','SEN','售后商务科','open','合同智能管理系统',$j${"section":"售后商务科","old":"","oldNew":"EAS-ACT-2026-SEN-001","team":"SEN","name":"合同智能管理系统","scope":"项目背景：\n欧销售后商务团队面向泛欧30+国家管理着海量售后合同。传统纯人工管理模式面临查找难、费率及补充协议难以精准统计、履约风险被动等痛点。为解决上述难题，本项目在SPLM系统中引入AI智能体，打造“合同-店铺”精准绑定及全生命周期智能管理体系。通过将静态文档转化为结构化数据，实现秒级检索、多维业务统计以及合同到期与偏离条款的动态风险预警，全面提升部门运营效率与风险管控能力。\n\n执行要求：\n一、 技术实施路径\n本项目围绕“底层AI工作流搭建 + 前端SPLM系统嵌合”双核推进：\n1. AI工作流搭建：基于 Dify 平台构建合同智能解析与提取工作流，实现海量合同文本的结构化数据提取与智能识别。 \n2. SPLM系统嵌合： 在SPLM 系统调用将 Dify的AI 能力，落地可视化合同管理界面，实现“合同-店铺”自动化绑定及全流程线上管控。\n\n\n二、 预期交付成果\n1. 泛欧市场全量覆盖与集中存储。覆盖泛欧 30+ 国家/市场的售后及特定项目合同，将传统线下纸质及散乱电子文档统一迁移至云端，实现集中化智能存储与管理。  \n2.  “合同-店铺”精准映射与识别。实现已签署合同（含历史合同与补充协议）与对应经销商/授权网点店铺的 1:1 自动化精准绑定与智能识别。   \n3. 全生命周期动态履约与风险监控。将静态合同文件转化为可查询、可计算的结构化数据；建立动态看板，对合同到期（如 30 天/90 天/1 年内到期）、条款偏离（如工时费、折扣、违约责任上限等标准模板差异）进行实时预警与追踪。   \n4. 智能检索与多维数据统计。提供基于 AI 的系统内秒级智能搜索能力，支持针对特定时间节点、国家平均工时费率、特定条款等复杂业务需求的多维统计与输出。   \n\n三、 核心价值总结\n在 SPLM 系统中全新上线合同智能管理模块，实现动态风险预警，辅助店铺精细化管理与服务支撑。","pic":"段梦醒Blair","exec":[],"start":"2026-11-10","end":null,"actual":null,"exts":[],"updates":[{"date":"2026-11-11","text":"1. Dify工作流经多轮测试优化，已满足信息准确度要求。\n2. SPLM系统合同管理界面设计已完成。","by":"段梦醒Blair"}],"origStatus":"In Progress","sheet":"待办跟进项","rf":"2026-11-12","nw":1,"kind":"follow","status":"open","ftype":"incubate","code":"SEN-26-F03","id":"f40","history":[{"at":"2026-11-12","by":"系统","text":"由新进度表同步（页签 待办跟进项，表内编号 EAS-ACT-2026-SEN-001）"}]}$j$::jsonb)
insert into _dr_new (id, code) values ('p254','EAS-2026-BNB-008'), ('p255','EAS-2026-BNB-009'), ('p256','EAS-2026-CEE-003'), ('p257','EAS-2026-SEN-006'), ('p258','EAS-2026-SEN-007'), ('p259','EAS-2026-SEN-008'), ('p260','EAS-2026-SEN-009'), ('f40','SEN-26-F03');
